{"resourceIdentifier":"4056","resourceName":"La Yesca Landfill Gas Project","description":"The proposed project activity has the objective to capture and to flare/combustion the landfill gas produced in the landfill called, “RELLENO SANITARIO COLIHUES LA YESCA” located in the Rancagua Municipality, Chile. \r\nThe project activity will result in greenhouse gas (GHG) emission reduction from the RSSP through: 1-Burning CH4 in flares and/or group generators; and 2- generating electricity that will be part used for self-consumption at the landfill facilities and the surplus part will be exported to the Chilean national grid, avoiding the dispatch of an equal amount of energy produced by fossil-fuelled thermal plants to that grid. The initiative avoids CO2 emissions and contributes to the regional and national sustainable development.\r\n\r\nThe project was the refurbishment to an efficient capture, collection and flaring system to burn CH4 (a greenhouse gas). These actions will reduce odors and adverse environmental impacts.\r\nAlso, the project will install group-generators that will combust the LFG to produce electricity, using part for self-consumption and the surplus part will be exported to the grid. The flares will be kept in operation due to LFG excess or other operational considerations. The LFG power plant will be expected to install up to 4.5 MW upon project completion. However, the final equipment that will be chosen (as well as the final installed capacity) may vary depending on the availability of the generator equipment in the market at the time of actual implementation of the second phase.\r\n\r\nThe landfill began its operation on July 1997, receiving of household waste. The landfill area is 21.79 hectares.\r\nFor this crediting period, estimates of GHG emission reductions are:\r\n\r\n•\tAnnual average GHG emission reduction: 166,554 tCO2e\r\n•\tTotal estimated GHG emission reductions: 1,165,880 tCO2e","location":{"latitude":-34.228321,"longitude":-70.704391},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-04-17","endExclusive":"2024-05-18","endInclusive":"2024-05-17"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4056"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Requinoa"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Veolia SU Chile S.A."},{"type":"string","value":"Region Metropolitana, Chile"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"100829"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"22 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"22/11/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 17/03/2023 - 16/03/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=88842&IDKEY=s0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9h122513118","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-La Yesca-PD v1 04 2023_draft rev JAS_new template_clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-04-24T15:39:54.59Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=88422&IDKEY=0iofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3a121933938","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1(RSCLY).pdf","uploadDate":"2023-04-13T21:50:42.8Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS 